# Dockerfile only ever COPYs .mvn/, mvnw, pom.xml and src/ — everything
# else here is build context that should never reach the daemon, let alone
# a layer. .env carries JWT_SECRET and the database password
# (.claude/rules/server.md, Configuration); it isn't COPYed today, but a
# future `COPY . .` would silently bake it into an image without this file.
.env
.env.example
target/
web-dist/
.idea/
.git
backup/
*.md
